<p style="text-align: center;"><img src="/images/2013/George's-Mill-Rooster.jpg" alt="A painting of a rooster in a 3/4 pose with partially unfinished background." width="350" height="456" /></p>
<p style="text-align: center;">George's Mill Rooster. 12"x9" oil on linen. 2013.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">I visited some local farms over the Loudoun Farm Tour weekend looking for some residents to paint. &nbsp;The rooster at George's Mill was molting and had lost most of his tail feathers so I sketched out a three-quarter view of him. &nbsp;I put most of my painting effort into the 1 square inch area around his eye and comb.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">This painting and the rabbit will be available at the Loudoun Sketch Club Fall Show at Hillsboro Vineyard in November. &nbsp;More details to follow.</p>